{"id": "q0411", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Daeodon sa ta is a type of giant ground sloth. It lived during the Pleistocene epoch, which was about 2. 6 million to 11, 700 years ago. This massive creature could weigh up to several ton s and stood as tall as an elephant when standing. Despite its size, it had relatively small head s with short sn ows compared to other gra zing animals of that time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
