{"id": "q0438", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 2, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Green tea is good for health because it's packed with antioxidants that help protect your cells from damage. It can boost metabolism, improve brain function, and even support heart health by lower ing bad cholesterol. Plus, it helps reduce inflammation in the body. Just remember to drink it without added sugar for the best benefits!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0442", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So UPI is a payment system in India. It' s like a digital wallet that allows people to send and receive money quickly using their phone numbers or virtual address es instead of bank accounts directly. Think of it as being similar to services like Apple Pay or Google Pay, but specifically designed for the Indian market.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0448", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are so many great science fiction movies out there. I think some of my favorite s include 2 001 A Space Odyssey, Bl ade Runner, Star Wars, The Matrix, Interstellar, and Inception. Each one has its own unique take on the genre and offers something different for fans to enjoy.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0454", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A broken mind is a canvas for chaos where thoughts paint themselves in vivid colors you never asked for. It’s like a storm inside your head, loud and un invited but somehow still mesmerizing. Imagine a garden over grown with ideas that shouldn’t be there—some beautiful, some we t and wild. Your mind might be cracked open just enough to let in light from places you didn’t know existed. And sometimes, it’ s not broken at all—it’s just rearranged, like a puzzle where every piece fits in an unexpected way, making sense only when no one else is looking.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 31, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0464", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There are a lot of different options. You can take the sub way, which is very popular and convenient because it's underground and goes to many parts of the city. Or you can walk if you're close enough to your destination. If you' re going farther away, maybe taking a bus or even a taxi would be better. And some people also use ride-sharing apps like Uber or Ly ft for more flexible travel. So there are lots of choices depending on where you're going and how much time you have.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0472", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "In the late 19 9 0s, grunge music was popular.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0476", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Hey, check the sky, it's wide and bright, The sun is shining with pure light, Cloud s are drifting slow, like dreams in flight. Blue stretches far and deep, Where eagles so ar and glide, A canvas painted by nature, No need for words to hide. Moon rises up when night comes near, Silver beams cut through the dark, Stars blink their secrets in the air, Tell ing tales of love and care. Wind whispers through the trees, As leaves dance on the breeze, Sky' s my stage, my soul takes flight, In this open space, I find my place. So look up, just take a breath, The sky will set you free, From the ground below, To where your heart can grow.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0483", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "万圣节服装是一种让人变得像超人、巫婆或怪物的特别衣服，让我们玩得很开心。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0496", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "人工智能的进步对就业市场的影响是双刃剑。一方面，它会取代一些重复性强、规则明确的工作，比如数据录入、流水线操作或客服等岗位，这些工作可能会被自动化系统替代。另一方面，人工智能也会催生新的职业机会，比如AI训练师、算法工程师、数据分析员以及人机协作专家等岗。同时，职业技能需要不断更新，强调创造力、批判性思维和情感交流能力的工作更难被替代。所以，未来的关键在于人如何学习适应新技术，通过培训提升自身竞争力，从而在新的工作环境中找到定位。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 40, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0503", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "有一天，一台能够预测未来的电脑被发明了。它能够通过分析大量的数据来预测未来的发展趋势。这个电脑被称为“未来预测机”。人们开始用它来预测天气、股市和自然灾害等重要事件。但是，当人们试图用它来预测个人生活时，却遇到了困难。因为人的生活是复杂的，不可预测的。所以这个电脑最终只能帮助人们更好地理解未来，而不能改变未来。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 37, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0509", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "One of the United States'key foreign policiesis promotingdemocracyand human rightsaroundthe world.TheU.S. often supports countries thatare working towardfreer elections, respect forindividual freedoms,andrule of law. Thiscaninvolve providing aid,offeringdiplomaticsupport, oreven working withinternational organizationstohelpstrengthen democraticinstitutionsin other nations.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 28, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0516", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "美国宪法第二修正案说，人民有保持和携带武器的权利。这是美国宪法中关于武器权利的条款。它被认为是为了维护公民自卫和对抗暴政而设立的。这个修正案至今仍是美国社会中关于枪支政策争论的焦点。", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "q0522", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "好的，这个任务是把三个物品加到购物清单里。首先得确认一下这些物品是什么。有Acer笔记本电脑、飞利浦运动豆和LG冰箱。这些东西都是消费品，通常买的时候需要注意品牌和型号。接下来要看购物清单是在哪儿管理的，比如手机应用或者纸质记录。假设现在用的是手机上的购物App，那就打开它，找到添加项目或者编辑清单的地方。然后逐条输入：第一个是Acer笔记本电脑，输入完之后检查一下拼写对不对。第二个是飞利浦运动豆，也就是飞利浦品牌的耳塞或者无线耳机，看起来像是健康相关的产品。最后一个是LG冰箱，说明可能要买家电了。每加一项都确认一下有没有重复，别漏掉哪个。这样", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
